   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Townscape Preference</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Townscape Preference Research Questionnaire\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Study One of Gjerde (2015): six street scenes from three British cities and one Norwegian city, each shown as a photographic street elevation (photographs stitched by the author, buildings labelled A, B, C ...) with two street-level photographs from either end of the street. For each scene participants rate visual pleasantness; the relationship of building heights, architectural styles, materials and finishes, and colours; and their overall preference, all on five-point scales; then say whether any building does not fit in the scene and, if so, which one and why. Answers are keyed by scene (scene1 ... scene6). Rebuilt from Morten Gjerde (2015), Street perceptions: A study of visual preferences for New Zealand streetscapes, PhD thesis, Victoria University of Wellington (CC BY-SA 4.0), with the scene boards cropped from its Figures 5.3-5.5 and the questions and answer labels from the Study One questionnaire in Appendix A. Analysis as in the thesis: per-scene means and the share of positive, neutral and negative answers, correlations and regression of overall preference on the five characteristics, and comparisons of architects/designers, planners and lay people. With 191 respondents in the Wellington region, scene 6 (a highly ordered street) was most preferred (M = 3.44 on the 5-point overall preference scale), then scenes 3 (3.23), 1 (3.11) and 4 (3.10), with scenes 2 (2.63) and 5 (2.47) least preferred; architectural style relationships predicted overall preference best. Differences from the original study: (1) the thesis showed the six scenes as A1 boards on a pinboard in libraries, planning departments and a university atrium with a paper form; here each scene is shown on screen, one at a time, in the same order; (2) the consent and instruction text is shortened from the form's cover page; (3) the 'which building does not fit' text box is required only when a building is said not to fit; (4) the boards are copies from the thesis figures, so fine detail is lower than on the printed A1 boards; (5) the 'Somewhat like' label of the overall preference scale reads 'Somewhat like arous-' on the printed form, a typo we corrected.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\"scenes\"],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\"name\": \"start\", \"elements\": [\n    {\"type\": \"consent\", \"name\": \"consent\", \"title\": \"I agree to take part. The survey is anonymous and there is no way of linking responses to any one individual.\", \"isRequired\": true, \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\", \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"}\n   ]},\n   {\"name\": \"scenes\", \"elements\": [\n    {\"type\": \"rating\", \"name\": \"pleasantness\", \"title\": \"Please rate the visual pleasantness of this scene\", \"isRequired\": true, \"rateValues\": [{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Very unpleasant\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Somewhat unpleasant\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neutral\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Somewhat pleasant\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Very pleasant\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene (scene1 ... scene6).\"},\n    {\"type\": \"rating\", \"name\": \"heights\", \"title\": \"How do you feel about the relationship between the heights of buildings in this scene?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"rateValues\": [{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Strongly negative\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Somewhat negative\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neutral\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Somewhat positive\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Strongly positive\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene.\"},\n    {\"type\": \"rating\", \"name\": \"styles\", \"title\": \"How do you feel about the relationship of architectural styles in this scene?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"rateValues\": [{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Strongly negative\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Somewhat negative\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neutral\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Somewhat positive\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Strongly positive\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene.\"},\n    {\"type\": \"rating\", \"name\": \"materials\", \"title\": \"How do you feel about the relationship of building materials and finishes?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"rateValues\": [{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Strongly negative\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Somewhat negative\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neutral\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Somewhat positive\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Strongly positive\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene.\"},\n    {\"type\": \"rating\", \"name\": \"colours\", \"title\": \"How do you feel about the relationship of colours in this scene?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"rateValues\": [{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Strongly negative\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Somewhat negative\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neutral\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Somewhat positive\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Strongly positive\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene.\"},\n    {\"type\": \"rating\", \"name\": \"preference\", \"title\": \"Please indicate your overall preference for this scene\", \"isRequired\": true, \"rateValues\": [{\"value\":1,\"text\":\"Strongly dislike\"},{\"value\":2,\"text\":\"Somewhat dislike\"},{\"value\":3,\"text\":\"Neutral\"},{\"value\":4,\"text\":\"Somewhat like\"},{\"value\":5,\"text\":\"Strongly like\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene.\"},\n    {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"fit\", \"title\": \"In your opinion, are there any buildings that do not fit within this scene?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\":\"all_fit\",\"text\":\"All buildings fit\"},{\"value\":\"not_fit\",\"text\":\"One or more building does not fit\"}], \"description\": \"Keyed by scene.\"},\n    {\"type\": \"comment\", \"name\": \"misfit\", \"title\": \"If so, please indicate which one(s) and briefly state your reasons.\", \"description\": \"Keyed by scene; asked only when a building does not fit.\"}\n   ]},\n   {\"name\": \"about\", \"elements\": [\n    {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"gender\", \"title\": \"What is your gender?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\":\"female\",\"text\":\"Female\"},{\"value\":\"male\",\"text\":\"Male\"}]},\n    {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"age\", \"title\": \"What is your age?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\":\"under25\",\"text\":\"Under 25 years\"},{\"value\":\"25-39\",\"text\":\"25–39 years\"},{\"value\":\"40-54\",\"text\":\"40–54\"},{\"value\":\"55-69\",\"text\":\"55–69 years\"},{\"value\":\"70+\",\"text\":\"70 years and above\"}]},\n    {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"occupation\", \"title\": \"Which of these best describes your occupation?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\":\"architecture\",\"text\":\"Architecture / Urban Design\"},{\"value\":\"planning\",\"text\":\"Planning\"},{\"value\":\"other_design\",\"text\":\"Other design profession\"},{\"value\":\"other_professional\",\"text\":\"Other professional\"},{\"value\":\"non_professional\",\"text\":\"Non professional i.e. manufacturing or trade\"},{\"value\":\"student\",\"text\":\"Student\"},{\"value\":\"retired\",\"text\":\"Retired\"},{\"value\":\"not_employed\",\"text\":\"Not currently employed\"},{\"value\":\"other\",\"text\":\"Other than those listed\"}]},\n    {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"education\", \"title\": \"What is your highest level of education?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\":\"secondary\",\"text\":\"Secondary School\"},{\"value\":\"diploma\",\"text\":\"Diploma or certificate\"},{\"value\":\"bachelors\",\"text\":\"Bachelors degree\"},{\"value\":\"postgraduate\",\"text\":\"Post-graduate degree\"},{\"value\":\"doctorate\",\"text\":\"Doctorate\"}]}\n   ]}\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1f24;--muted:#5d6068;--accent:#2f5d62;--line:#d9d8d3;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#dcebea}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.scene{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:8px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}\n.scene img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.scene a{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--accent)}\n.blk{margin-top:16px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.blk:first-child{margin-top:0;padding-top:0;border-top:0}\n.blk.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:8px}\n.blk .t{font-weight:600}.blk .t i{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;margin-right:6px}\n.o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n.o label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 2px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\n.o label b{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink)}\n.o label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--ink)}\n.o input{display:none}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\nlabel.opt:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\ntextarea{width:100%;min-height:80px;font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.5em;line-height:1.5}\n.credit{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n@media (max-width:700px){.scene{position:static}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Street scenes and questionnaire: Morten Gjerde (2015), Street perceptions: A study of visual preferences for New Zealand streetscapes, PhD thesis, Victoria University of Wellington, Figures 5.3–5.5 and Appendix A (doi:10.26686/wgtn.17021132, CC BY-SA 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='gjerde2015:state', N=6, RATE=['pleasantness','heights','styles','materials','colours','preference'], BG=['gender','age','occupation','education'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e&&!app.querySelector('.miss'))e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Townscape preference</h1><p>This study investigates people’s perceptions and preferences for groups of buildings. You will see six street scenes. Each is shown as a street elevation (all buildings along one side of the street, labelled A, B, C …) with a photograph taken from each end of the street. For each scene, answer seven short questions. It should take about 15–20 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='scene';st.k=0;st.a={};save();route();});};\n  }\n  function scenePage(){\n    var k=st.k,key='scene'+(k+1),f=files[key],a=st.a[key]||(st.a[key]={});\n    var h='<h2>Scene '+(k+1)+' of '+N+'</h2><div class=\"scene\"><img alt=\"Scene '+(k+1)+': street elevation and end-of-street photographs\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"><a href=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the full-size image</a></div><div class=\"card\">';\n    RATE.forEach(function(n,i){var q=Q[n];h+='<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><div class=\"t\"><i>'+(k+1)+'.'+(i+1)+'</i>'+esc(q.title)+'</div><div class=\"o\">'+(q.rateValues||[]).map(function(s){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+s.value+'\"'+(a[n]==s.value?' checked':'')+'><b>'+s.value+'</b>'+esc(s.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>';});\n    var qf=Q.fit;\n    h+='<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"fit\"><div class=\"t\"><i>'+(k+1)+'.7</i>'+esc(qf.title)+'</div>'+(qf.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"fit\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"'+(a.fit===c.value?' checked':'')+'> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+\n       '<div id=\"mf\"'+(a.fit==='not_fit'?'':' hidden')+'><div style=\"margin-top:10px\">'+esc(Q.misfit.title)+' <span style=\"color:var(--muted)\">(list any that do not fit here, e.g. “Building E – too tall”)</span></div><textarea name=\"misfit\">'+esc(a.misfit||'')+'</textarea></div></div>';\n    h+='<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(k<N-1?'Next scene':'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    app.innerHTML=h;\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var miss=[];\n      RATE.forEach(function(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)a[n]=Number(x.value);else miss.push(n);});\n      var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"fit\"]:checked');if(x)a.fit=x.value;else miss.push('fit');\n      var t=(app.querySelector('textarea[name=\"misfit\"]')||{}).value||'';a.misfit=t;\n      if(a.fit==='not_fit'&&!t.trim())miss.push('fit');\n      save();\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(n){app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"'+n+'\"]').classList.add('miss');});app.querySelector('.blk.miss').scrollIntoView({block:'center'});\n        return err(a.fit==='not_fit'&&!t.trim()&&miss.length===1?'Please say which building(s) do not fit and why.':'Please answer every question for this scene.');}\n      var sh={key:key,shown:[f.name]},L=RATE.map(function(n){return SPSite.answer(n,a[n],sh);});\n      L.push(SPSite.answer('fit',a.fit,sh));\n      if(a.fit==='not_fit')L.push(SPSite.answer('misfit',t.trim(),sh));\n      send(L,this,function(){if(k<N-1)st.k=k+1;else st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+BG.map(function(n,i){var q=Q[n];\n      return '<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><div class=\"t\"><i>7.'+(i+1)+'</i>'+esc(q.title)+'</div>'+(q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('')+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var L=[],miss=[];\n      BG.forEach(function(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)L.push(SPSite.answer(n,x.value));else miss.push(app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"'+n+'\"]'));});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});return err('Please answer all four questions.');}\n      send(L,this,function(){st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thanks again for your participation!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var b=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.blk');if(b){b.classList.remove('miss');hideErr();}\n    if(st&&st.step==='scene'){var a=st.a['scene'+(st.k+1)];if(RATE.indexOf(e.target.name)>=0)a[e.target.name]=Number(e.target.value);\n      if(e.target.name==='fit'){a.fit=e.target.value;document.getElementById('mf').hidden=a.fit!=='not_fit';}save();}});\n  app.addEventListener('input',function(e){if(e.target.name==='misfit'&&st&&st.step==='scene'){st.a['scene'+(st.k+1)].misfit=e.target.value;e.target.closest('.blk').classList.remove('miss');hideErr();save();}});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='scene')return scenePage();if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','fit','misfit'].concat(RATE,BG).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=[];for(var i=1;i<=N;i++)if(!files['scene'+i])need.push('scene'+i);\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"scenes\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.step)||a.consent!==true)st={step:'intro'};\n    if(!st.a)st.a={};\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
